    'jroc-ai-pro-bono/.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml': 'name: Deploy Backend\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - "backend/**"\n      - ".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml"\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    name: Deploy FastAPI to Railway\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Install Railway CLI\n        run: npm install -g @railway/cli\n\n      - name: Deploy to Railway\n        working-directory: backend\n        env:\n          RAILWAY_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.RAILWAY_TOKEN }}\n        run: railway up --service backend --detach\n\n      # â”€â”€ Alternative: Deploy to Render â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€\n      # - name: Deploy to Render\n      #   uses: johnbeynon/render-deploy-action@v0.0.8\n      #   with:\n      #     service-id: ${{ secrets.RENDER_SERVICE_ID }}\n      #     api-key: ${{ secrets.RENDER_API_KEY }}\n\n      - name: Notify on success\n        if: success()\n        run: echo "âœ… Backend deployed successfully"\n\n      - name: Notify on failure\n        if: failure()\n        run: echo "âŒ Backend deployment failed"\n',
    'jroc-ai-pro-bono/.github/workflows/deploy-frontend.yml': 'name: Deploy Frontend\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - "frontend/**"\n      - ".github/workflows/deploy-frontend.yml"\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    name: Deploy Next.js to Vercel\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Set up Node.js 20\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: "20"\n          cache: "npm"\n          cache-dependency-path: frontend/package-lock.json\n\n      - name: Install Vercel CLI\n        run: npm install -g vercel@latest\n\n      - name: Pull Vercel environment\n        working-directory: frontend\n        env:\n          VERCEL_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}\n          VERCEL_ORG_ID: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}\n          VERCEL_PROJECT_ID: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}\n        run: vercel pull --yes --environment=production --token=$VERCEL_TOKEN\n\n      - name: Build project artifacts\n        working-directory: frontend\n        env:\n          VERCEL_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}\n          VERCEL_ORG_ID: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}\n          VERCEL_PROJECT_ID: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}\n        run: vercel build --prod --token=$VERCEL_TOKEN\n\n      - name: Deploy to Vercel\n        working-directory: frontend\n        env:\n          VERCEL_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}\n          VERCEL_ORG_ID: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}\n          VERCEL_PROJECT_ID: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}\n        run: vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod --token=$VERCEL_TOKEN\n',
    'jroc-ai-pro-bono/.github/workflows/ci.yml': 'name: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n\njobs:\n  backend-lint-test:\n    name: Backend â€” Lint & Test\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    defaults:\n      run:\n        working-directory: backend\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Set up Python 3.11\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n        with:\n          python-version: "3.11"\n          cache: "pip"\n          cache-dependency-path: backend/requirements.txt\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n      - name: Lint with Ruff\n        run: ruff check . && ruff format --check .\n\n      - name: Type-check with mypy\n        run: mypy app/ --ignore-missing-imports\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        env:\n          SUPABASE_URL: ${{ secrets.SUPABASE_URL }}\n          SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY: ${{ secrets.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}\n          OPENAI_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.OPENAI_API_KEY }}\n          SECRET_KEY: test-secret-key-for-ci\n          ENVIRONMENT: test\n        run: pytest tests/ -v --cov=app --cov-report=xml\n\n      - name: Upload coverage\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v4\n        with:\n          file: backend/coverage.xml\n\n  frontend-lint-typecheck:\n    name: Frontend â€” Lint & Typecheck\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    defaults:\n      run:\n        working-directory: frontend\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Set up Node.js 20\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: "20"\n          cache: "npm"\n          cache-dependency-path: frontend/package-lock.json\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Lint\n        run: npm run lint\n\n      - name: Type-check\n        run: npm run typecheck\n\n      - name: Build\n        env:\n          NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL: https://placeholder.supabase.co\n          NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: placeholder-anon-key\n          NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: http://localhost:8000\n        run: npm run build\n\n  docker-build:\n    name: Docker â€” Build Images\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    needs: [backend-lint-test, frontend-lint-typecheck]\n    if: github.ref == \'refs/heads/main\'\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Set up Docker Buildx\n        uses: docker/setup-buildx-action@v3\n\n      - name: Build backend image\n        uses: docker/build-push-action@v5\n        with:\n          context: ./backend\n          push: false\n          tags: jroc-backend:ci\n\n      - name: Build frontend image\n        uses: docker/build-push-action@v5\n        with:\n          context: ./frontend\n          push: false\n          tags: jroc-frontend:ci\n',
    'jroc-ai-pro-bono/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md': '# Architecture Overview\n\n## System Design\n\n```\nâ”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”\nâ”‚                    Client (Browser)                      â”‚\nâ”‚              Next.js 14 App Router + Tailwind            â”‚\nâ””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”¬â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜\n                          â”‚ HTTPS / REST\nâ”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â–¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”\nâ”‚                  FastAPI Backend                          â”‚\nâ”‚   â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”  â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”  â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”             â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  /auth   â”‚  â”‚  /chat   â”‚  â”‚ /docs    â”‚             â”‚\nâ”‚   â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜  â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”¬â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜  â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”¬â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜             â”‚\nâ”‚              â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â–¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â–¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚   SupervisorAgent          â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â” â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”       â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â”‚Legal â”‚ â”‚Intake â”‚       â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â”‚Rsrch â”‚ â”‚Agent  â”‚       â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜ â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜       â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â” â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”    â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â”‚Draftingâ”‚ â”‚Escalat â”‚    â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â”‚ Agent  â”‚ â”‚ Agent  â”‚    â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜ â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜    â”‚              â”‚\nâ”‚              â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜              â”‚\nâ”‚                          â”‚                              â”‚\nâ”‚              â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â–¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”                 â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  VectorSearchService   â”‚                 â”‚\nâ”‚              â”‚  (OpenAI Embeddings)   â”‚                 â”‚\nâ”‚              â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”¬â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜                 â”‚\nâ””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜\n                           â”‚ Supabase SDK (service_role)\nâ”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â–¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”\nâ”‚                   Supabase (PostgreSQL)                   â”‚\nâ”‚   â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”  â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  Core Tables      â”‚  â”‚  pgvector Extension    â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  - cases          â”‚  â”‚  - document_chunks     â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  - conversations  â”‚  â”‚  - VECTOR(1536) cols   â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  - messages       â”‚  â”‚  - IVFFlat index       â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  - documents      â”‚  â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜      â”‚\nâ”‚   â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜  â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”  â”‚  RPC Functions          â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  Auth (built-in) â”‚  â”‚  - match_document_chunksâ”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  - Supabase Auth â”‚  â”‚  - get_case_summary     â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â”‚  - RLS Policies  â”‚  â”‚  - get_escalated_cases  â”‚      â”‚\nâ”‚   â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜  â””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜      â”‚\nâ””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜\n                           â”‚\nâ”Œâ”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â–¼â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”\nâ”‚             Celery Worker + Redis                         â”‚\nâ”‚   Document Ingestion Pipeline:                           â”‚\nâ”‚   Parse PDF/DOCX â†’ Chunk (tiktoken) â†’                   â”‚\nâ”‚   Embed (OpenAI) â†’ Upsert to Supabase                   â”‚\nâ””â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”˜\n```\n\n## Agent Routing Logic\n\n```\nUser Message\n     â”‚\n     â–¼\nSupervisorAgent (GPT-4o, temp=0)\n     â”‚ classifies intent to one of:\n     â”œâ”€ LEGAL_RESEARCH  â†’ RAG search + synthesis\n     â”œâ”€ INTAKE          â†’ guided form collection\n     â”œâ”€ DRAFTING        â†’ document generation\n     â””â”€ ESCALATION      â†’ crisis response + DB flag\n```\n\n## Data Flow: Document Ingestion\n\n```\nPOST /api/v1/documents/upload\n     â”‚\n     â–¼\nSave file to disk â†’ Insert document record (status=pending)\n     â”‚\n     â–¼\nCelery task: ingest_document_task\n     â”œâ”€ parser.py    â†’ extract text\n     â”œâ”€ chunker.py   â†’ split into 512-token overlapping chunks\n     â”œâ”€ embedder.py  â†’ OpenAI text-embedding-3-small (1536-dim)\n     â””â”€ Supabase     â†’ upsert document_chunks + update status=ready\n```\n\n## Security Architecture\n\n- **Auth**: Supabase Auth (email/password) + custom JWT for backend API\n- **RLS**: Every table has Row Level Security â€” users can only see their own data\n- **Service Key**: Backend uses `service_role` key â€” never exposed to the client\n- **Anon Key**: Frontend uses `anon` key â€” safe to expose, protected by RLS\n- **CORS**: Backend CORS restricted to configured `ALLOWED_ORIGINS`\n',
    'jroc-ai-pro-bono/docs/DEPLOYMENT.md': '# Deployment Guide\n\n## 1. GitHub Setup\n\n```bash\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m "feat: initial JROC AI Pro Bono Service setup"\ngit remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/jroc-ai-pro-bono.git\ngit push -u origin main\n```\n\n## 2. Supabase Setup (Required First)\n\n```bash\n# Install Supabase CLI\nnpm install -g supabase\n\n# Link to your existing project\nsupabase link --project-ref YOUR_PROJECT_REF\n\n# Apply all migrations\nsupabase db push\n\n# Deploy edge functions\nsupabase functions deploy match_documents\n```\n\nYour project ref is the string after `https://` and before `.supabase.co` in your project URL.\n\n## 3. GitHub Secrets to Configure\n\nGo to your repo â†’ Settings â†’ Secrets and variables â†’ Actions â†’ New repository secret:\n\n| Secret | Value |\n|---|---|\n| `SUPABASE_URL` | `https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co` |\n| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` | Your service role key |\n| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | Your OpenAI API key |\n| `RAILWAY_TOKEN` | Railway deploy token (backend) |\n| `VERCEL_TOKEN` | Vercel deploy token (frontend) |\n| `VERCEL_ORG_ID` | Your Vercel org ID |\n| `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID` | Your Vercel project ID |\n\n## 4. Backend â€” Deploy to Railway\n\n1. Go to [railway.app](https://railway.app) â†’ New Project â†’ Deploy from GitHub\n2. Select `jroc-ai-pro-bono` repo â†’ select `backend` folder as root\n3. Add environment variables from `backend/.env.example`\n4. Railway auto-detects Dockerfile\n\n## 5. Frontend â€” Deploy to Vercel\n\n```bash\ncd frontend\nnpm install -g vercel\nvercel --prod\n```\n\nAdd environment variables in Vercel dashboard:\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (your Railway backend URL)\n\n## 6. Worker â€” Deploy to Railway (separate service)\n\nAdd a second service in Railway, same repo, command:\n```\ncelery -A app.core.celery_app worker --loglevel=info\n```\n\nAdd a Redis service in Railway and set `REDIS_URL` to the internal URL.\n\n## 7. Verify Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Health check\ncurl https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL/health\n\n# Expected response:\n# {"status":"ok","version":"1.0.0","environment":"production"}\n```\n',
    'jroc-ai-pro-bono/supabase/config.toml': '# Supabase local development configuration\n# See: https://supabase.com/docs/guides/cli/config\n\n[api]\nport = 54321\nschemas = ["public", "graphql_public"]\nextra_search_path = ["public", "extensions"]\nmax_rows = 1000\n\n[db]\nport = 54322\nshadow_port = 54320\nmajor_version = 15\n\n[studio]\nport = 54323\napi_url = "http://localhost"\n\n[inbucket]\nport = 54324\nsmtp_port = 54325\npop3_port = 54326\n\n[storage]\nfile_size_limit = "50MiB"\n\n[auth]\nsite_url = "http://localhost:3000"\nadditional_redirect_urls = ["https://localhost:3000"]\njwt_expiry = 3600\nenable_signup = true\n\n[auth.email]\nenable_signup = true\ndouble_confirm_changes = true\nenable_confirmations = false\n\n[analytics]\nenabled = false\n',
